From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yodaliu <yodaliu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:52:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Revert "disp: rotator: disable cpu sync during dma_buf
 calls"

This reverts commit a551760f1403f6464a43d6fcefac43a4d87c370a.

The stock FiiO M21 FW 1.1.0 msm_drm sets only DMA_ATTR_DELAYED_UNMAP in sde_mdp_data_map.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 rotator/sde_rotator_util.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/rotator/sde_rotator_util.c b/rotator/sde_rotator_util.c
index 46b0a582..f29fba8a 100644
--- a/rotator/sde_rotator_util.c
+++ b/rotator/sde_rotator_util.c
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
 /*
  * Copyright (c) 2012, 2015-2019, 2021, The Linux Foundation. All rights reserved.
- * Copyright (c) 2022-2023 Qualcomm Innovation Center, Inc. All rights reserved.
+ * Copyright (c) 2022 Qualcomm Innovation Center, Inc. All rights reserved.
  */
 #define pr_fmt(fmt)	"%s: " fmt, __func__
 
@@ -903,7 +903,7 @@ static int sde_mdp_map_buffer(struct sde_mdp_img_data *data, bool rotator,
 		 * provided here.
 		 */
 		data->srcp_attachment->dma_map_attrs |=
-			DMA_ATTR_DELAYED_UNMAP | DMA_ATTR_SKIP_CPU_SYNC;
+			DMA_ATTR_DELAYED_UNMAP;
 
 		if (data->srcp_dma_buf && data->srcp_dma_buf->ops &&
 				data->srcp_dma_buf->ops->get_flags) {
